[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0010","text":"（雾子……明明是“妖异”这么难的角色，\n　她却这么努力……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0020","text":"（──看起来没问题。我还是别碍事，\n　退到后面去吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0040","text":"哇，雾子！？\n吓我一跳…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0050","text":"哇……\n对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0060","text":"抱歉，是我反应过度了……\n没注意到你在这里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0070","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0080","text":"……？\n有那么好笑吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0090","text":"啊……不是……\n那个……呵呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010800_01_0100","text":"我是不是……\n能成为“妖异”了……"}]
